---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Page not found · BitcoinKeys.guide"
  description="That page doesn't exist — here's how to get back on track to holding your own Bitcoin."
>
  <section class="prose nf">
    <p class="eyebrow">404</p>
    <h1>That page took a <span class="accent">wrong turn</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">The link's broken or the page moved — no harm done. Here's the quickest way back to what you were probably after:</p>

    <div class="nf-cards">
      <a href="/start" class="nf-card">
        <h3>New here? Start here →</h3>
        <p>The whole guide in teaching order — six chapters, from what a key actually is to the setups real holders use.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/quiz" class="nf-card">
        <h3>Not sure what you need? Take the quiz →</h3>
        <p>Six plain questions → a setup, a roadmap from where you are, and a checklist that fits you.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/wallets" class="nf-card">
        <h3>Comparing devices? →</h3>
        <p>An honest, no-affiliate comparison of the current hardware wallets.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/glossary" class="nf-card">
        <h3>Looking up a word? →</h3>
        <p>Every term in the guide, in plain English.</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="sub">Or head back to the <a href="/">home page</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .nf h1 { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .nf-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin: 1.8rem 0 1.4rem; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .nf-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .nf-card { display: block; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--surface);
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text); transition: border-color .14s ease, transform .14s ease; }
  .nf-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .nf-card h3 { margin: 0 0 0.35rem; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--accent); }
  .nf-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
